  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Fisherfolk Participation in Fisheries Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will strengthen the capacity and governance systems of seven artisanal fisherfolk cooperatives in six coastal regions of Guyana to enhance their ability to identify and document IUU fishing and improve fisheries management in Guyana.</narrative>
  </description>
